OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after 'chop shop' found
OL,4,Aon farmland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who played an "important role" in
OL,7,Fan organised crime group which
OL,8,Ftransported #325,000 worth of stolen
OL,9,Fcar parts to a secret "chop shop" has
OL,10,Fbeen jailed.
OL,12,FOsvaldas Ubarevicius, from Birmingham,
OL,13,Fwould drive illegal materials to a
OL,14,Flock-up on farmland near Malmesbury in
OL,15,FWiltshire. The parts would then be sold
OL,16,Fon.
OL,18,FThe 31-year-old was found guilty of
OL,19,Fconspiring to dishonestly receive
OL,20,Fstolen goods and possessing criminal
OL,21,Fproperty after a trial at Winchester
OL,22,FCrown Court.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
