OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after 'chop shop' found
OL,4,Aon farmland
OL,5,
OL,6,FUbarevicius, a Lithuanian national, was
OL,7,Fjailed on Thursday for 30 months. After
OL,8,Fhe has spent his time behind bars, he
OL,9,Fis due to be deported.
